{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26719","headline":"赠终南山傅山人 · 姚合","name":"赠终南山傅山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七十未成事，终南苍鬓翁。\n老来诗兴苦，贫去酒肠空。\n蟠蛰身仍病，鹏抟力未通。\n已无烧药本，唯有着书功。\n白马时何晚，青龙岁欲终。\n生涯枯叶下，家口乱云中。\n潭静鱼惊水，天晴鹤唳风。\n悲君还姓傅，独不梦高宗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}